        {
          "id": "p1",
          "text": "The region faces a significant power shortfall after a grid incident triggered a protective response. A power unit experienced a sudden shutdown, leading the grid operator to issue a red alert. In response, emergency measures were implemented to prevent system collapse, including load shedding for grid stability. The result is a large-scale power deficit affecting the community.",
          "source": {
            "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
            "fragments": [
              "why-0",
              "how-1",
              "how-2",
              "result-0"
            ],
