          },
          "warnings": [],
          "fit": 0.65
        },
        {
          "id": "p3",
          "text": "The powerless suppliers, eleven generators affected by the outage, now see their capacity severely reduced. This energy asset situation stems from a grid incident and extreme weather that strained the system. A power shortage of more than 950 megawatts has left the region in need of stability.",
