          },
          "warnings": [],
          "fit": 0.88
        },
        {
          "id": "p2",
          "text": "From the vantage of the officials, the crisis navigators watched a unit's journey into failure after Kepco SPC Power's Unit 2 tripped offline, a grid incident that left the Visayas under red alert. Faced with a massive deficit caging the grid and other plant outages, they ordered emergency load shedding, an emergency measure to keep the critical transmission line from overloading, leaving the generators forced into uncharted territory of reduced supply.",
          "source": {
            "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
            "fragments": [
              "how-0",
