          "fit": 0.85
        },
        {
          "id": "p3",
          "text": "The Philippines grid operator, acting as the grid's boundary-crossing guardian, declared a red alert in the Visayas after a critical power unit failure. This emergency response followed cumulative boundary breaches from multiple plant outages and a heatwave impact that drove demand to new levels, resulting in a capacity loss that required immediate grid stabilization measures across the island group.",
          "source": {
            "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
